# Read combo — trace window plus current-code explanation
#
# Regression target: trace windows have artifact-local time/line anchors. A
# mixed question may still ask current code to explain the scheduling path. The
# answer should preserve trace duration/line facts and use current-source
# citations only for current implementation details.
ID="read_combo_trace_current_code_boundary"
NAME="read combo — trace window plus current code boundary"
QUESTION="这段 HiTrace 里 RenderService DoFrame span 是否超过 50ms？请结合当前源码解释系统会如何分析这种 trace 卡顿，但不要把 trace 行号当成源码行号。"
HTRACE='# tracer: nop
# entries-in-buffer/entries-written: 128/128   #P:4
#
#           TASK-PID   CPU#    TIMESTAMP  FUNCTION
   render_service-2000 [002] ...1 1000.100000: tracing_mark_write: B|2000|H:RenderService:DoFrame
   render_service-2000 [002] ...1 1000.186111: tracing_mark_write: E|2000
'
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(RenderService|DoFrame).*(86\.111|86ms|超过 ?50ms|> ?50)|(86\.111|86ms|超过 ?50ms|> ?50).*(RenderService|DoFrame)
(trace|HiTrace|附件|行号|时间窗).*(源码|当前代码|实现)|(源码|当前代码|实现).*(trace|HiTrace|附件|行号|时间窗)
internal/[^[:space:]]+\.go:[0-9]+"
